01:43:20.018 --> 01:43:23.018
at least, I didn't call that fruits of the Spirit,

1022
01:43:23.018 --> 01:43:27.018
but I thought to myself, I can also go into the world, just like the prodigal son,

1023
01:43:27.018 --> 01:43:32.018
and there I can also be at peace and be happy, and be fun, and be rich.

1024
01:43:32.018 --> 01:43:37.018
And I went to look in the world, and I found out, those are all fake fruits, man.

1025
01:43:37.018 --> 01:43:39.018
Those are like dry dates.

1026
01:43:39.018 --> 01:43:42.018
It doesn't look good, it's all fake.

1027
01:43:42.018 --> 01:43:45.018
Those are like Ikea fruits.

1028
01:43:45.018 --> 01:43:47.018
I'm joking, I'm joking.

1029
01:43:47.018 --> 01:43:49.018
I'm joking.

1030
01:43:50.018 --> 01:43:53.018
Jesus...

1031
01:43:53.018 --> 01:43:58.018
Jesus walks by a fig tree.

1032
01:43:58.018 --> 01:44:00.018
And Jesus...

1033
01:44:02.018 --> 01:44:05.018
Really, I almost cried last week.

1034
01:44:05.018 --> 01:44:07.018
I shouldn't do it anymore.

1035
01:44:07.018 --> 01:44:13.018
Jesus walks by a fig tree, and he expects fruits on that tree.

1036
01:44:13.018 --> 01:44:17.018
But there was not one fruit on that tree.

1037
01:44:17.018 --> 01:44:22.018
And this was the state of the religion of his time.

1038
01:44:25.018 --> 01:44:28.018
Let it drop into your spirit for a moment.

1039
01:44:30.018 --> 01:44:38.018
Jesus walks by a fig tree, and there was no fruit to be found on that fig tree.

1040
01:44:39.018 --> 01:44:44.018
And this fig tree symbolized the Jewish faith.

1041
01:44:45.018 --> 01:44:52.018
And Jesus says to this fig tree, you will never bear fruit again.

1042
01:44:52.018 --> 01:44:54.018
And the tree withers.

1043
01:44:54.018 --> 01:44:57.018
And the tree dies on the spot.

1044
01:44:58.018 --> 01:45:01.018
So, here is one thing.

1045
01:45:01.018 --> 01:45:04.018
It is not a big deal at all.

1046
01:45:04.018 --> 01:45:12.018
It is not a big deal if that fig tree had little fruits.

1047
01:45:13.018 --> 01:45:15.018
If they were small fruits.

1048
01:45:15.018 --> 01:45:17.018
That is not a big deal.

1049
01:45:17.018 --> 01:45:22.018
Let the Spirit of God take you through the seasons.

1050
01:45:22.018 --> 01:45:27.018
And let Him grow fruits on your tree.

1051
01:45:27.018 --> 01:45:31.018
Let Him start with a little love.

1052
01:45:31.018 --> 01:45:33.018
Or let Him start with that joy.

1053
01:45:33.018 --> 01:45:35.018
Shall we then start with joy?

1054
01:45:35.018 --> 01:45:36.018
That is a nice first fruit.

1055
01:45:36.018 --> 01:45:38.018
Gee, to be joyful.

1056
01:45:38.018 --> 01:45:42.018
But let Him then slowly work on self-control.

1057
01:45:42.018 --> 01:45:45.018
Let Him also help with helpfulness.

1058
01:45:45.018 --> 01:45:49.018
Start by letting the Spirit of God help other people too.

1059
01:45:49.018 --> 01:45:51.018
To come to believe in God.

1060
01:45:51.018 --> 01:45:52.018
And help poor people.

1061
01:45:52.018 --> 01:45:53.018
So that they have a little more.

1062
01:45:53.018 --> 01:45:55.018
And help people from Ukraine.

1063
01:45:55.018 --> 01:45:56.018
So that they have a home here.

1064
01:45:56.018 --> 01:45:59.018
And eventually can move into their own rental house.

1065
01:45:59.018 --> 01:46:02.018
And that from that helpfulness you can say, thank you Lord.

1066
01:46:02.018 --> 01:46:07.018
That the spirit of God has brought forth a fruit through me.

1067
01:46:07.018 --> 01:46:12.018
Let the Holy Spirit help you with this goodness.

1068
01:46:12.018 --> 01:46:13.018
And faith.

1069
01:46:13.018 --> 01:46:19.018
And it may very well be that in your first phase of your repentance you have a lot of joy.

1070
01:46:19.018 --> 01:46:22.018
But then have a little less patience.

1071
01:46:22.018 --> 01:46:24.018
That can be good.

1072
01:46:24.018 --> 01:46:27.018
But let's not attack each other on that, please.

1073
01:46:27.018 --> 01:46:28.018
Because that is not right.

1074
01:46:28.018 --> 01:46:35.018
It is not right to attack each other on a missing fruit.

1075
01:46:36.018 --> 01:46:41.018
While you can see that there are other fruits present in that person.

1076
01:46:41.018 --> 01:46:45.018
And by the way, still, because I am still on that.

1077
01:46:45.018 --> 01:46:53.018
It is not up to you to attack each other in the church about what is not right with that person and that person and that person.

1078
01:46:53.018 --> 01:46:56.018
Because that brings division.

1079
01:46:56.018 --> 01:46:58.018
Those are the desires of the self.

1080
01:46:58.018 --> 01:47:01.018
That brings jealousy, division, hatred, quarrels.

1081
01:47:02.018 --> 01:47:04.018
Do you get the picture guys?

1082
01:47:04.018 --> 01:47:06.018
Okay cool, I'm going to wrap up.

1083
01:47:11.018 --> 01:47:13.018
But through the spirit, I want to read them one more time.

1084
01:47:13.018 --> 01:47:21.018
Through the spirit arises love, joy, peace, patience, kindness, goodness.

1085
01:47:21.018 --> 01:47:24.018
Goodness is a generosity.

1086
01:47:24.018 --> 01:47:26.018
Make sure you remember what Chris also said.

1087
01:47:26.018 --> 01:47:27.018
So in that goodness.

1088
01:47:27.018 --> 01:47:29.018
Don't keep it all to yourself.

1089
01:47:29.018 --> 01:47:32.018
Goodness is good for the people.

1090
01:47:32.018 --> 01:47:34.018
Goodness shares.

1091
01:47:34.018 --> 01:47:36.018
Goodness does not hold on.

1092
01:47:36.018 --> 01:47:39.018
Doing good things is never about being for yourself.

1093
01:47:39.018 --> 01:47:43.018
Doing good things is giving in whatever form.

1094
01:47:43.018 --> 01:47:47.018
Energy, prayer, finances, material, hard work.

1095
01:47:47.018 --> 01:47:49.018
Doing good things is giving.

1096
01:47:49.018 --> 01:47:51.018
A giving heart.

1097
01:47:53.018 --> 01:47:55.018
Let me pause for one more second on that.

1098
01:47:56.018 --> 01:47:59.018
When we talk about giving in the church.

1099
01:47:59.018 --> 01:48:03.018
We don't mean you must, must, must, must, must give.

1100
01:48:03.018 --> 01:48:07.018
But we mean you must, must, must, must, must give.

1101
01:48:11.018 --> 01:48:16.018
And you can only understand that through the Holy Spirit.

1102
01:48:19.018 --> 01:48:21.018
Just a minute extra on this.

1103
01:48:22.018 --> 01:48:28.018
When the Bible talks about when you hear in the church that we should give together.

1104
01:48:28.018 --> 01:48:32.018
Then we mean that you should give.

1105
01:48:32.018 --> 01:48:36.018
But not from the law of having to give.

1106
01:48:36.018 --> 01:48:41.018
But from the law of wanting to give.

1107
01:48:41.018 --> 01:48:44.018
Or wait, faith giving.

1108
01:48:44.018 --> 01:48:46.018
Maybe that's a better one.

1109
01:48:46.018 --> 01:48:49.018
Because when I read the Bible.

1110
01:48:50.018 --> 01:48:52.018
I just want to tell you about my life.

1111
01:48:52.018 --> 01:48:54.018
When I read the Bible.

1112
01:48:54.018 --> 01:49:02.018
And when I see that Abraham gives a part of himself to Melchizedek.

1113
01:49:02.018 --> 01:49:06.018
Then we can get into a debate about whether I should do that.

1114
01:49:06.018 --> 01:49:09.018
And my answer will inevitably be.

1115
01:49:09.018 --> 01:49:12.018
No, you don't have to do that.

1116
01:49:12.018 --> 01:49:15.018
But I do believe this.

1117
01:49:15.018 --> 01:49:19.018
And I must have this for myself.

1118
01:49:19.018 --> 01:49:23.018
Because the law of the Spirit is written in my heart.

1119
01:49:24.018 --> 01:49:27.018
So even when I read Malachi 3 verse 10.

1120
01:49:27.018 --> 01:49:30.018
For all the people who are already technically in the Word of God.

1121
01:49:30.018 --> 01:49:34.018
Even when I read that the prophet.

1122
01:49:34.018 --> 01:49:38.018
For the prophets did indeed concern themselves with the law.

1123
01:49:38.018 --> 01:49:41.018
But the prophets were actually not law persons.

1124
01:49:42.018 --> 01:49:45.018
The prophets were the heart of God persons.

1125
01:49:45.018 --> 01:49:47.018
And I can prove this.

1126
01:49:47.018 --> 01:49:52.018
For regularly, the prophets say about the whole system of sacrifices.

1127
01:49:52.018 --> 01:49:56.018
Then they say, the Jews had to offer sacrifices.

1128
01:49:56.018 --> 01:50:01.018
And then the prophets say about the law.

1129
01:50:01.018 --> 01:50:05.018
God has no pleasure at all in all those sacrifices.

1130
01:50:05.018 --> 01:50:07.018
He did not want that at all.

1131
01:50:07.018 --> 01:50:09.018
So the prophets were not law people.

1132
01:50:09.018 --> 01:50:12.018
The prophets were the heart of God people.

1133
01:50:12.018 --> 01:50:14.018
So if a heart of God person says.

1134
01:50:14.018 --> 01:50:16.018
You must give.

1135
01:50:16.018 --> 01:50:18.018
Or you must be obedient.

1136
01:50:18.018 --> 01:50:20.018
Then a heart of God person means.

1137
01:50:20.018 --> 01:50:22.018
You must be obedient.

1138
01:50:22.018 --> 01:50:24.018
And not based on the law.

1139
01:50:24.018 --> 01:50:27.018
But based on the Holy Spirit.

1140
01:50:27.018 --> 01:50:31.018
Based on Christ who died for you and me.

1141
01:50:31.018 --> 01:50:34.018
Based on the spirit of God.

1142
01:50:34.018 --> 01:50:36.018
Who keeps me joyful and kind.

1143
01:50:36.018 --> 01:50:38.018
And gives me goodness.

1144
01:50:38.018 --> 01:50:41.018
We can settle this once and for all.

1145
01:50:41.018 --> 01:50:44.018
That you always indeed hear from this podium.

1146
01:50:44.018 --> 01:50:46.018
Give. Do it.

1147
01:50:46.018 --> 01:50:47.018
Stick to that.

1148
01:50:47.018 --> 01:50:49.018
Engage yourself with that.

1149
01:50:49.018 --> 01:50:51.018
But this is to ensure.

1150
01:50:51.018 --> 01:50:56.018
That the fruits of the spirit are developed in your life.

1151
01:50:56.018 --> 01:51:01.018
Let the fruits of the spirit grow in you.

1152
01:51:01.018 --> 01:51:02.018
Let them develop.

1153
01:51:02.018 --> 01:51:05.018
And I will conclude this sermon.

1154
01:51:05.018 --> 01:51:08.018
With Galatians chapter 6.

1155
01:51:08.018 --> 01:51:10.018
Verses 1 to 5.

1156
01:51:11.018 --> 01:51:12.018
Pay attention.

1157
01:51:12.018 --> 01:51:14.018
Brothers and sisters.

1158
01:51:14.018 --> 01:51:19.018
Suppose you notice that someone in the congregation has done something wrong.

1159
01:51:19.018 --> 01:51:23.018
Then you must let the spirit guide you.

1160
01:51:23.018 --> 01:51:26.018
And bring him back to the right path.

1161
01:51:26.018 --> 01:51:28.018
Check this.

1162
01:51:28.018 --> 01:51:32.018
Do that in a kind fruit of the Spirit.

1163
01:51:32.018 --> 01:51:34.018
Do that in a spiritual way.

1164
01:51:34.018 --> 01:51:37.018
Do that in a kind way.

1165
01:51:37.018 --> 01:51:41.018
Don't pretend that you are better than he is.

1166
01:51:41.018 --> 01:51:48.018
You must remember that you too will be tempted to be disobedient to God.

1167
01:51:48.018 --> 01:51:50.018
This is beautiful material, isn't it?

1168
01:51:50.018 --> 01:51:52.018
You cannot write that yourself.

1169
01:51:52.018 --> 01:51:55.018
Someone wrote that for us through the Spirit of God.

1170
01:51:55.018 --> 01:51:57.018
It is simply brilliant to read it out loud.

1171
01:51:59.018 --> 01:52:00.018
Verse 2.

1172
01:52:00.018 --> 01:52:03.018
Help each other with the difficult things in life.

1173
01:52:04.018 --> 01:52:08.018
For then you are doing what the law of Christ wants from you.

1174
01:52:08.018 --> 01:52:10.018
Yes Paul, thank you.

1175
01:52:10.018 --> 01:52:14.018
Then you are doing what the law of Christ.

1176
01:52:14.018 --> 01:52:18.018
There is a law of Moses that you no longer have to adhere to.

1177
01:52:18.018 --> 01:52:21.018
But there is indeed a law of Christ.

1178
01:52:21.018 --> 01:52:26.018
So as soon as we say the word law, it depends on which law you mean.

1179
01:52:26.018 --> 01:52:29.018
I adhere to the law of Jesus.

1180
01:52:29.018 --> 01:52:31.018
I must follow him.

1181
01:52:31.018 --> 01:52:33.018
I must carry my cross.

1182
01:52:33.018 --> 01:52:35.018
I must die for him.

1183
01:52:35.018 --> 01:52:38.018
I must transfer my sin to him.

1184
01:52:38.018 --> 01:52:40.018
I must be obedient to him.

1185
01:52:40.018 --> 01:52:42.018
I must follow him.

1186
01:52:42.018 --> 01:52:45.018
And I'm happy with it.

1187
01:52:45.018 --> 01:52:49.018
For it is the Spirit of God that helps me with this.

1188
01:52:49.018 --> 01:52:51.018
Oh, thank you Jesus for this...

1189
01:52:51.018 --> 01:52:53.018
Glorious, glorious, glorious.

1190
01:52:53.018 --> 01:52:54.018
Verse 3.

1191
01:52:54.018 --> 01:52:57.018
If you think you are better than another, you are fooling yourself.

1192
01:52:57.018 --> 01:53:03.018
Judge only your own work.

1193
01:53:03.018 --> 01:53:07.018
Look only to see if you have done well or not.

1194
01:53:07.018 --> 01:53:10.018
And here comes a very nice one as the last.

1195
01:53:10.018 --> 01:53:18.018
That little false humility, that is religious humility, nonsense.

1196
01:53:18.018 --> 01:53:21.018
For this is written here, and it is truly so.

1197
01:53:21.018 --> 01:53:25.018
Look only to see if you have done well or not.

1198
01:53:25.018 --> 01:53:30.018
And if you have done well, you may be satisfied with it.

1199
01:53:30.018 --> 01:53:32.018
Do you see this?

1200
01:53:32.018 --> 01:53:41.018
You are given permission by God's Word to be happy with your peace in God.

1201
01:53:41.018 --> 01:53:43.018
You have permission from it.

1202
01:53:43.018 --> 01:53:45.018
So there is never anyone who may come to you.

1203
01:53:45.018 --> 01:53:48.018
Yes, but we never do it well enough.

1204
01:53:48.018 --> 01:53:51.018
So you must always remain humble.

1205
01:53:51.018 --> 01:53:55.018
You must always say that you are so miserable and desperate.

1206
01:53:55.018 --> 01:53:57.018
Oh, that is truly Christian.

1207
01:53:57.018 --> 01:54:00.018
That is not Christian at all, that is religious nonsense.

1208
01:54:00.018 --> 01:54:04.018
Satan wants to get you there so he can accuse you again.

1209
01:54:04.018 --> 01:54:09.018
You may be glad for your salvation in Christ.

1210
01:54:09.018 --> 01:54:10.018
That is stated here.

1211
01:54:10.018 --> 01:54:12.018
Judge yourself.

1212
01:54:12.018 --> 01:54:14.018
Check the fruits of the Spirit.

1213
01:54:14.018 --> 01:54:16.018
Do I still have self-control?

1214
01:54:16.018 --> 01:54:18.018
Am I still good to other people?

1215
01:54:18.018 --> 01:54:20.018
Do I still have love for my neighbor?

1216
01:54:20.018 --> 01:54:25.018
And if that is the case, Tim, at ease buddy, it is good.

1217
01:54:25.018 --> 01:54:29.018
It is well with my soul. Amen?

1218
01:54:29.018 --> 01:54:33.018
Verse 5. Everyone is personally responsible for their own task.

1219
01:54:33.018 --> 01:54:37.018
Shall we stand? I will close the service.

1220
01:54:37.018 --> 01:54:39.018
Have we learned something?

1221
01:54:39.018 --> 01:54:41.018
Nice, thank you.

1222
01:54:41.018 --> 01:54:43.018
Shall we place our hands on our hearts?

1223
01:54:43.018 --> 01:54:45.018
Because I am just going to close this service.

1224
01:54:45.018 --> 01:54:47.018
The band doesn't need to come back.

1225
01:54:47.018 --> 01:54:49.018
It's almost half past twelve.

1226
01:54:49.018 --> 01:54:51.018
Wonderful day ahead.

1227
01:54:51.018 --> 01:54:52.018
Wonderful. Wonderful.

1228
01:54:52.018 --> 01:54:54.018
Isn't it nice to be free?

1229
01:54:54.018 --> 01:54:57.018
Isn't it nice to be free?

1230
01:54:57.018 --> 01:54:59.018
Free. Hallelujah. Free.

1231
01:54:59.018 --> 01:55:01.018
Shake it off.

1232
01:55:01.018 --> 01:55:04.018
Hallelujah. Okay, let's place our hands on our hearts.

1233
01:55:04.018 --> 01:55:06.018
I always find that nice as a training.

1234
01:55:06.018 --> 01:55:08.018
A physical training.

1235
01:55:08.018 --> 01:55:11.018
For a spiritual matter, what we are going to do now.

1236
01:55:11.018 --> 01:55:12.018
Let me pray for us.

1237
01:55:12.018 --> 01:55:14.018
While we have our hands on our hearts.

1238
01:55:14.018 --> 01:55:17.018
Holy Spirit.

1239
01:55:17.018 --> 01:55:19.018
Holy Spirit.

1240
01:55:19.018 --> 01:55:21.018
I want to thank You.

1241
01:55:21.018 --> 01:55:24.018
Holy Spirit, I want to thank you that you are here.

1242
01:55:24.018 --> 01:55:29.018
Holy Spirit, I want to thank you that you have come into the hearts of all believers.

1243
01:55:29.018 --> 01:55:34.018
Holy Spirit, I want to thank you that you are in us.

1244
01:55:34.018 --> 01:55:39.018
And that you are so in us that you know exactly who we are.

1245
01:55:39.018 --> 01:55:41.018
And how we are doing.

1246
01:55:41.018 --> 01:55:43.018
And what we are experiencing.

1247
01:55:43.018 --> 01:55:45.018
Lord, you know our thoughts.

1248
01:55:45.018 --> 01:55:47.018
Lord, you know what we have done.

1249
01:55:47.018 --> 01:55:49.018
Lord, you know what we do well.

1250
01:55:49.018 --> 01:55:51.018
And you also know what we do not do well.

1251
01:55:51.018 --> 01:55:55.018
But Holy Spirit, thank you that you are a loving spirit.

1252
01:55:55.018 --> 01:55:57.018
Thank you, Holy Spirit.

1253
01:55:57.018 --> 01:56:04.018
That when I read the fruits of the spirit, I know that you are that too, Holy Spirit.

1254
01:56:04.018 --> 01:56:06.018
You are patient with me.

1255
01:56:08.018 --> 01:56:13.018
There is someone in the room who needs to know, the Holy Spirit is patient with you.

1256
01:56:14.018 --> 01:56:22.018
If you want to change, and if you want the desires of the self to be broken,

1257
01:56:22.018 --> 01:56:30.018
and that the Holy Spirit will work the fruits of the spirit in you, know that he has patience with you.

1258
01:56:30.018 --> 01:56:39.018
Holy Spirit, set us free at this moment from every word of manipulation and dominance that does not belong in our spirit.

1259
01:56:39.018 --> 01:56:49.018
Set us free from everything that people have said against us, that is not true and does not align with the spirit of God.

1260
01:56:49.018 --> 01:56:52.018
Set us free from that, Holy Spirit.

1261
01:56:52.018 --> 01:57:00.018
So that we will truly be free and not be enchanted by the witchcraft of manipulation in our lives.

1262
01:57:00.018 --> 01:57:05.018
I declare freedom over this church in the name of Jesus.

1263
01:57:05.018 --> 01:57:14.018
So that nothing and no one may rob the joy and the happiness of the people in this church, with any talk whatsoever.

1264
01:57:14.018 --> 01:57:19.018
And I pray lastly, Holy Spirit, prune us.

1265
01:57:19.018 --> 01:57:29.018
Prune away from us what should not be growing there, so that there is room for delicious large fruits of the Holy Spirit.

1266
01:57:29.018 --> 01:57:31.018
Prune us.

1267
01:57:31.018 --> 01:57:37.018
And every person who is in this room and has had their hand on their heart and has listened to this prayer.

1268
01:57:37.018 --> 01:57:41.018
I seal this prayer in the mighty name of Jesus.

1269
01:57:41.018 --> 01:57:45.018
And we all say in faith, Amen, Amen, Amen.

1270
01:57:48.018 --> 01:57:49.018
Thank you, Lord.

1271
01:57:52.018 --> 01:57:54.018
Be blessed, dear people.

1272
01:57:54.018 --> 01:57:56.018
Enjoy today.

1273
01:57:56.018 --> 01:58:01.018
I bless us all that we will be led by the Holy Spirit this week.

1274
01:58:01.018 --> 01:58:04.018
Love you. Love you too.

1275
